WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.317
Rex rubbed his head.

2
00:00:08.318 --> 00:00:12.603
"Sid, you made that acorn fall!"

3
00:00:12.604 --> 00:00:15.471
Sid snorted.

4
00:00:15.472 --> 00:00:20.389
"No, I didn't!"

5
00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:27.025
The small dino gulped. "Uh-oh!"

6
00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:30.299
"Your tail hit the tree!" Rex said.

7
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.444
"It did not!" Sid said.

8
00:00:35.445 --> 00:00:40.761
Rex and Sid stomped and roared.

9
00:00:40.762 --> 00:00:44.289
The small dino was scared.

10
00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:52.481
"They're really mad!" she thought.

11
00:00:52.482 --> 00:00:56.544
Sara and Tor ran over.

12
00:00:56.545 --> 00:01:01.094
"Why are you fighting?" Sara asked.

13
00:01:01.095 --> 00:01:05.352
Rex told them about the acorn.

14
00:01:05.353 --> 00:01:10.129
"Sid's tail shook the tree," Rex said.

15
00:01:10.129 --> 00:01:13.405
"That wasn't nice, Sid," Tor said.

16
00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:16.910
"What?" Sid said.

17
00:01:16.911 --> 00:01:21.796
"Tor, that's not fair," Sara said.

18
00:01:21.797 --> 00:01:25.572
"Maybe Sid didn't do it."

19
00:01:25.573 --> 00:01:28.842
"Don't be silly," Tor said.

20
00:01:28.843 --> 00:01:33.929
"Sid always shakes trees!"

21
00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:40.071
Sara groaned. "This is silly!

22
00:01:40.072 --> 00:01:44.590
Who cares how the acorn fell?"

23
00:01:44.591 --> 00:01:49.879
"I do!" Rex and Sid said.

24
00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.710
Sara huffed.

25
00:01:53.711 --> 00:01:59.740
"You're all silly!"

